{
  "description": "A registration index (registrations2/{id}/index.json) or page, filtered by the verdicts for its leaves. A leaf's version is its catalogEntry.version, else the last segment of its @id without .json. Leaves not positively allowed go, including leaves with no readable version or no verdict. Counts follow the leaves that stay; lower and upper are left as they were. A page given only as a link stays, pointed at the proxy. Any date_source_unavailable verdict makes the answer a 503.",
